<description>&lt;p&gt;CAR troops have completed Rwanda special forces and basic special operations training, expanding their capabilities. Near the CAR border, navy marines and other forces have neutralised 34 Boko Haram and ISWAP fighters in Lake Chad. The CAR military chief held high-level talks with Rwanda Defence Force leadership, and both chiefs discussed cooperation while fresh France-Chad ties were noted. The conflict recorded 246 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQTTctQUwyTnBNUDg0ZTlzV3ZRMWJrS1ZjeDBxbVkydmtiazF5ZEMwZWJJR1FQU19RX1RjUzVXS0hJdWRSeUpQVHY2YXVfTlZxVWRRNGN3b183dFZxZXV2RmJaem1sQmZDZ1hxVlZoM1o1YnpaSjJqckhEeU4yUEtVQVgzRUcxY0xiSW05eS1Wdl9CaXYyUmRuRzVlYTJUMklYcExHMVdfRjlLRjBwT1NQMjdRTmt0NDlo?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPcFlLSHpRcG05Y3VMRHhyR1djMmY1RVlhM3RSejd2WVpZNzhXOWE3M285SGxoeVI1VE1TQ2FtQjY5eXZWVmdiVUZibTVKVFdPWUJ5NlNoeEkxNzk3NEhDaWVKYUt0T2tVSEh5TkVmS0Z0bklKRFdYSWRUa3lnSXkwZmFlZzZWMVBCR1cxcU1oRzdRTjFMR0tIS29GLTJWUkI4RHFndXNpOGlKTFJnSERhOGhmaG40Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NBC 6 South Florida&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNemw3V0VzNHFGck9LdDN4WFdqR2ZBMEZ0SHloekNzRk5UeXZlT3R0Q1MxbzZnWmI5eXNKNlVoMkpjRGVzcEtBT09EUzNKc3ZwemRTR0d1VlJFTlozNVFVeEhuajF4OGFTNGVzZVZCeFc4VVB5SGlEQVdUekhIaGxPb1p5VnJZQ2lZR0d4M1o0SFBUMnZQY25ZM2lKLTNUY28?oc=5&quot;&gt;Stars and Stripes&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPVmZhV2ZTbFdNU09fenJQMmdGYUNxaW16Qjd0SktITFg3cFNxb3I3dXVTWXdXOWhjSlJUWVgyQjNKcUoxR19fakFrTVhMNE1KazlhSWxfY2liUHNUbVRzQS1zTldHejZTWllrRTdmeXZ5X3k5Zm9xRXB0Wnc5LThnUzViSEV2dFA4a3pmUEVGczJDYkZrcklfNUJPM0daN3lxWTFaaA?oc=5